    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Zero moving‑day surcharges</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The quoted price must be final, with no extra charges added on the day of the move for things like “last‑minute loading,” “fuel,” or “traffic delays.” Any optional services (e.g., extra packing material) should be listed separately and agreed to in writing before the move begins.</p>
