    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">IBA‑approved bills</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">For government or corporate claims, the mover must issue bills that conform to the Institute of Business Administration (IBA) standards. These bills include a detailed description of the services rendered, GST breakdown, and a unique invoice number, making them readily acceptable for reimbursement or audit processes.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #a855f722; color: #a855f7; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">04</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">100 % declared‑value transit insurance</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The mover should offer insurance that covers the full declared value of every item in transit, without caps or deductibles that reduce the payout. The policy terms, coverage limits, and claim procedure must be clearly stated in the contract, and the premium should be included in the quoted price.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #ec489922; color: #ec4899; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">05</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Transparent tax and GST handling</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">All applicable taxes must be shown separately on the invoice, with the exact GST rate applied. This prevents any surprise tax adjustments after the service is completed.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #06b6d422; color: #06b6d4; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">06</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Clear cancellation and amendment policy</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The contract should outline the procedure, notice period, and any refundable portion of the fee if the move is rescheduled or canceled, ensuring no hidden penalties.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<p>By insisting on these elements—zero surcharges, an itemized written contract, IBA‑approved billing, and full‑value insurance—you guarantee a fair, auditable, and stress‑free relocation experience in Chapra. Always request a printed copy of the contract and invoice before signing, and keep both documents for future reference or claim submissions.</p></div>
